{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a single-modality RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder, achieving 0.4849 validation accuracy and 0.4639 F1, lower than the multimodal baseline (config_016) of 0.5266 accuracy and 0.5104 F1. This suggests the multimodal approach may offer incremental value, but the effectiveness of specific fusion strategies and encoder combinations remains uncertain without further comparison."
}

